OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for setting fire to    
OL,4,Ashared property                        
OL,6,FA man has been jailed for              
OL,7,Ftwo-and-a-half years after admitting   
OL,8,Fputting his housemate's life in danger 
OL,9,Fby starting a fire.                    
OL,11,FLincoln Crown Court heard that Fernando
OL,12,FMartins, 60, set fire to his bedroom in
OL,13,Fthe shared property on Holbeach Road,  
OL,14,FSpalding on 7 September.               
OL,16,FAfter a smoke alarm triggered, his     
OL,17,Fhousemate went to the room and         
OL,18,Fextinguished the blaze with two buckets
OL,19,Fof water, the court was told.          
